      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Partial translation",
          "value": "<p>There is a woman [here] who has been \u201ca widow in [her husband\u2019s] lifetime\u201d for more than three years now. We have heard that her husband is in Egypt. His name is Yosef, and with him is another man also named Yosef. He is a young man with reddish hair, and his distinguishing characteristic is that he was a Qaraite, one who does not acknowledge the words of our sages, and now has become a Rabbanite. She is an \u2018aguna with four children who are dying of starvation. In your kindness, if he is there, tell him to return to his wife. And if he has left, or you have heard that he is verifiably deceased, please send her a letter here in Damascus [to that effect].</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
